    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d637">

                <pb facs="0613" n="529" xml:id="pg529"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 860c.48/12a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Assistant to the Third Assistant Secretary of
                        State</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Ruddock</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to John B. Denvir, jr., of the Bureau of Enenmy Trade, War
                        Trade Board</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-03-18">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 18, 1918</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Mr. Denvir</hi>:
                    Confirming our telephone conversation of this morning, I beg to state that the
                    President has authorized the transmission of the following relief
                    remittances:</p>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Poland, and Turkey not under British Occupation</hi>
                </p>
                <table cols="6" rows="5">
                    <row role="label">
                        <cell>Poland</cell>
                        <cell role="num">$300,000</cell>
                        <cell>per month,</cell>
                        <cell>of which</cell>
                        <cell role="num">$200,000</cell>
                        <cell>general relief</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell role="num">100,000</cell>
                        <cell>individual</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>Turkey</cell>
                        <cell role="num">$150,000</cell>
                        <cell>per month</cell>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell/>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell cols="3">which may be properly divided into</cell>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell role="num">$100,000</cell>
                        <cell>general relief</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell role="num">50,000</cell>
                        <cell>individual</cell>
                    </row>
                </table>
                <p>I should be happy to receive from you, if convenient, a statement of the proposed
                    allotments.</p>
                <p>Very sincerely yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">A. B. Ruddock</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
